{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23921","headline":"分司初到洛中偶题六韵兼戏呈冯尹 · 白居易","name":"分司初到洛中偶题六韵兼戏呈冯尹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相府念多病，春宫容不才。\n官衔依口得，俸料逐身来。\n白首林园在，红尘车马回。\n招呼新客侣，扫掠旧池台。\n小舫宜携乐，新荷好盖桮。\n不知金谷主，早晚贺筵开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23921.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23921","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}